Article 11

Regional Government is obligated and responsible to: a. establish a system for implementation of protection of women and children, especially victims of violence, and their families;

b. provide facilities and infrastructure including safe houses/shelters, Human Resources comprising lawyers, doctors and psychologists-psychiatrists, companion volunteers, spiritual figures, economists, and social workers;

c. enhance the institutional capacity of protection organizers, victims of violence especially for women, children and their families; d. establish a data and information center on protection, victims of violence especially for women, children and their families; e. conduct monitoring and evaluation of the implementation of protection, victims of violence especially for women, children and their families.

